###

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:b0003; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:p0001; source-lines: 1-1; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala-metadata
```


(a) the gaming activity is conducted by or on behalf of a charitable organisation,

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:b0004; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:p0002; source-lines: 3-3; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

(b) not less than 12.5% of the gross proceeds of the gaming activity are paid to the benefiting org

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:b0005; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:p0003; source-lines: 4-4; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

(c)the total value of the expenses of conducting the gaming activity (excluding
the cost of prizes) does not exceed 12.5% of the gross proceeds of the gaming activity

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:b0006; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:p0004; source-lines: 5-6; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

(d) the total value of all of the prizes for 1 session of the gaming activity does not
exceed $10,000 and does not exceed 75% of the gross proceeds from the gaming activity

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:b0007; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:p0005; source-lines: 7-8; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

(e)no more than 48 tickets are permitted to be sold to the same participant

<!-- rtdf-block-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:b0008; role: provision; provision-id: NSW_community_gaming/nsw_charity_housie:p0006; source-lines: 9-9; relation: formalizes-preceding -->
```catala
```

